Sybil Liberty Briefers are designed to advise high school-level students 
about their rights in school.  Sybil Liberty is a cartoon character who 
appears in the print version of the publications in this section of the 
Free Reading Room.  Ordering information, prices for multiple copies, 
and an order form can be found in section 11 of the Free Reading Room.

Someday, when these documents are available as a mosaic resource, Sybil 
will be able to appear here to speak for herself.
